<section class="section doc-section" id="transfer-bank">
  <h2>Transfer bank <span class="doc-auth-tag">butuh autentikasi</span></h2>
  <p>Kirim saldo langsung ke rekening bank lewat TokoVoucher. Tidak ada katalog produk di baliknya &mdash; kode bank dan nominal bebas per permintaan.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Keterangan</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>POST</td><td class="mono">/api/v1/bank-transfers</td><td><code>bankCode</code>, <code>targetNumber</code>, <code>nominal</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td>GET</td><td class="mono">/api/v1/bank-transfers</td><td>Riwayat transfer bank</td></tr>
        <tr><td>GET</td><td class="mono">/api/v1/bank-transfers/:refId</td><td>Detail satu transfer bank</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

