<section class="section doc-section" id="webhook">
  <h2>Webhook</h2>
  <p>Endpoint ini menerima callback dari supplier/payment gateway, bukan dipanggil oleh client.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <code class="mono">POST /api/v1/webhooks/tokovoucher</code> &mdash; callback
      status transaksi top up maupun transfer bank (dibedakan lewat <code>ref_id</code>).
      Wajib menyertakan header <code>X-TokoVoucher-Authorization</code> berisi
      <code>md5(member_code:signature_key:ref_id)</code>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <code class="mono">POST /api/v1/webhooks/kipay</code> &mdash; callback status
      deposit QRIS. Wajib menyertakan header <code>X-Webhook-Signature</code>
      berisi <code>sha256=</code> + HMAC-SHA256(raw body, webhook secret project KiPay).
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section doc-section" id="contoh">
  <h2>Contoh alur lengkap</h2>

  <h3>1. Daftar dan simpan API key</h3>
  <pre class="code-block"><code>curl -X POST https://domainmu/api/v1/auth/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{ "email": "kamu@contoh.com", "password": "passwordkuat", "name": "Nama Kamu" }'</code></pre>
  <p>Ambil <code>data.apiKey.key</code> dari respons dan simpan sebagai <code>X-API-Key</code> untuk semua panggilan berikutnya.</p>

  <h3>2. Top up e-wallet</h3>
  <pre class="code-block"><code>curl -X POST https://domainmu/api/v1/transactions \
  -H "X-API-Key: sk_..." \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: order-12345" \
  -d '{ "brand": "DANA", "nominal": 25000, "targetNumber": "081234567890" }'</code></pre>

  <h3>3. Transfer ke rekening bank</h3>
  <pre class="code-block"><code>curl -X POST https://domainmu/api/v1/bank-transfers \
  -H "X-API-Key: sk_..." \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: transfer-12345" \
  -d '{ "bankCode": "bca", "targetNumber": "1234567890", "nominal": 100000 }'</code></pre>

  <h3>4. Isi saldo lewat QRIS</h3>
  <pre class="code-block"><code>curl -X POST https://domainmu/api/v1/balance/deposits \
  -H "X-API-Key: sk_..." \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{ "amount": 50000, "method": "QRIS" }'</code></pre>
  <p>
    Respons berisi <code>qrPayload</code> (payload EMV QRIS mentah) dan
    <code>totalPaid</code> (nominal + kode unik yang harus dibayar persis).
    Gambar QR siap pakai ada di
    <code>GET /api/v1/balance/deposits/:invoiceId/qr.png</code>.
  </p>

  <h3>5. Regenerate API key</h3>
  <pre class="code-block"><code>curl -X POST https://domainmu/api/v1/auth/api-keys/&lt;id&gt;/regenerate \
  -H "X-API-Key: sk_..."</code></pre>
  <p><code>&lt;id&gt;</code> didapat dari <code>GET /api/v1/auth/api-keys</code>. Key lama langsung tidak berlaku begitu ini dipanggil.</p>
</section>

